    "description": {
      "value": "This brownish-orange lens always seems dusty and gritty, even when wet. While you have the Ochre Fulcrum Lens invested, lassitude grips you. You gain resistance 10 to mental damage and a +2 status bonus to saves against emotion effects. You can also activate the lens in the following ways.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou hold up the Ochre Fulcrum Lens in your hand and the item casts crushing despair (DC 31 Will save).\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Traits:** attack, possession\n\nas Crimson Fulcrum Lens, but the melee spell attack modifier is +21."
    },
